---
import TextPage from '../components/TextPage.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<TextPage title="Privacy Policy" heading="Privacy policy" updated="November 2026">
  <p>This policy explains how www.ronnyasraf.com, operated by Ronny Asraf, handles information about visitors.</p>

  <h2>1. Data we collect</h2>
  <p>The site has no forms, accounts or newsletter, and does not collect your name, phone number or email address. If you contact me by WhatsApp, phone or email, I receive only what you choose to send.</p>

  <h2>2. Cookies and analytics</h2>
  <p>The site does not use advertising or tracking cookies. Our hosting provider may keep standard technical server logs (such as IP address, browser type and time of visit) for security and reliability. We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to count visits and see which pages are viewed. It does not use cookies, does not track you across other sites and does not identify individual visitors.</p>

  <h2>3. Legal basis</h2>
  <p>Information is handled in line with Israel's Privacy Protection Law (including Amendment 13), the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and other applicable privacy rules.</p>

  <h2>4. Sharing of information</h2>
  <p>Personal information is never sold, traded or rented. The site is hosted and delivered by Cloudflare, Inc., which processes technical data on our behalf only to deliver and measure the site.</p>

  <h2>5. Data retention</h2>
  <p>No personal data is stored by the site. Messages you send me directly are kept only as long as needed to answer and to work together.</p>

  <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
  <p>You may ask to access, correct or delete any information I hold about you by writing to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>

  <h2>7. Security</h2>
  <p>The site is served over an encrypted connection (HTTPS).</p>

  <h2>8. Updates to this policy</h2>
  <p>This policy may be updated from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with a new "Last updated" date.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Ronny Asraf, <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>
</TextPage>
